                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Cubetractor quickly won me the fuck over. I went in expecting a simple little puzzle game and instead got puzzle-driven Dark Souls—except instead of getting my ass kicked by some seven-foot medieval bastard, I'm getting psychologically violated by fucking cubes.\n\nThe story is surprisingly engaging, the puzzles start simple and then gradually turn into \"WHAT THE FUCK AM I SUPPOSED TO DO HERE?\" territory, and every successful solution feels like I've just performed open-heart surgery on a Rubik's Cube.\n\nClever, addictive, occasionally brutal, and weirdly satisfying.\n\nCame for the cubes, stayed because apparently I enjoy suffering.",
